# hypernix.industrial_range

LLM-as-judge wrapper routing through a CodeOven for scoring.

## Documentation pages

No dedicated guide has been published for this subsystem yet. See the API reference and source module.

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `IndustrialRange()`

LLM-as-judge labeler.

### `IndustrialRange.compare(prompt, a, b) -> str`

Return ``\"A\"``, ``\"B\"``, or ``\"T\"`` (tie).

### `industrial_range(judge, **kwargs) -> IndustrialRange`

Construct an :class:`IndustrialRange` around ``judge``.

